data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":2154,"response":{"id":"resp_0c17af8fc60a9be3016adb51160b048191b2ebcda725dad4e0","object":"response","created_at":1792758038,"completed_at":1792758058,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through structured submit_draft (preferred) or the compatible submit_artifact wrapper. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0c17af8fc60a9be3016adb511a1fe48191a84d481ee9652d8b","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq21EaY9IJKZUgRnAoAlF_FvZOZQIXcxJI9J9lcrMMPxI0laFOh-AsWZU6znhM_9TZ6EIqn8MmvyvoMNffOubJ27TG2weSOG1Pbw0awkR9D-NfTeCxZg3LmeUL-g776UZMA_G6iLC8dUUhgjpkj6uRnhey4KZDQ5g0RTMqjHeWNPuXcqUAROZufZUVLWluFhaIptOoQmBujG2_Knf47CnCear0bIgCydoeoLePxRcTheV5bHdrAYhIfcXsUgiU2Pyb5hN2NK8IBsFm-TL0cG2arT896mX4fmNt74T_4YRgNAjJC9SC7UVmsTuhu5TrBf6y3Z70XFBBAYANLPySu6zJmBEvQgL_ajMOt1Ss-4QdwZfciIJ_2NM1-4oBppOBwRi6GGZKieMjlg2dqKnnMHmVh5ojoSIAL_Zl78SJHqOxwUnsd0ANdPvVajQBxDj9_x_vVw6Qt0zdldQZtngqF8PY8jcddwxIya1ip1Ixvh77OaBVK-bwtYBBK9kGhd6pAvs8hB1fiW48L1V2pEjTpyBhkfxaQSIBySqzI1w97X3rb3T4atBiD3BlVYyGPTuvAlvv-pt-iM3wbtvdAsABdyGprgqiaWQh0tdIn3GluAJ7PexXJIimf8-RIdrl8oLkpiUpMAVXMeayQJw1GkcWc0XamUpiWt7UNGzttFQQOa-bgO61Ol5KLAluja97hTl3fI9r0Ig5bnG4XG5-6ptr_yu2_hjjEo5yPR2CcyjkMTR2O9FBdfv1McZS8QyvvAqBW2O54JsTYF0aQ1ovW1vyoP0a-LyZR-CahpCtkRy61Qtn5SQ0-Fj8xCSibmlCdFaZlt5g0ODqSi2aA-zEeLz-Hr6q4VEUsRfEIOWtBADbHubvDGGebutlEqO75MPpn8sLxAUSEUsKtFt4dszKm3Fn2Um7mCVpizxWxJWg8CiBUmusO7Bpg1AZj6SgAsxQfY3jRCttLNOjoCjR_uDqCjNktm4tC4I2f3-qk